  "bv29:10.3": "",
  "bv29:10.4": "",
  "bv29:11.1": "ekā dāṭhā tidasapure ",
  "bv29:11.2": "ekā nāgapure ahu ",
  "bv29:11.3": "ekā gandhāravisaye ",
  "bv29:11.4": "ekā kāliṅgarājino. ",
  "bv29:12.1": "cattāḷīsa samā dantā ",
  "bv29:12.2": "kesā lomā ca sabbaso ",
  "bv29:12.3": "devā hariṃsu ekekaṃ ",
  "bv29:12.4": "cakkavāḷaparamparā. ",
  "bv29:13.1": "vajirāyaṃ bhagavato ",
  "bv29:13.2": "patto daṇḍo ca cīvaraṃ ",
  "bv29:13.3": "nivāsanaṃ kulaghare ",
  "bv29:13.4": "paccattharaṇaṃ silavhaye. ",
  "bv29:14.1": "pāṭalīputtanagare ",
  "bv29:14.2": "karakaṃ kāyabandhanaṃ ",
  "bv29:14.3": "campāyaṃ udakasāṭakā ",
  "bv29:14.4": "uṇṇalomañca kosale. ",
  "bv29:15.1": "kāsāvakaṃ brahmaloke ",
  "bv29:15.2": "veṭhanaṃ tidase pure ",
  "bv29:15.3": "[pāsāṇake padaṃ seṭṭhaṃ yathāpi kacchataṃ puraṃ] nisīdanaṃ avantīsu ",
  "bv29:15.4": "devaraṭṭhe attharaṇaṃ tadā. ",
  "bv29:16.1": "araṇi ca mithilāyaṃ ",
  "bv29:16.2": "videhe parisāvanaṃ ",
  "bv29:16.3": "vāsī sūcigharañcāpi ",
  "bv29:16.4": "indapatthapure tadā. ",
  "bv29:17.1": "parikkhārā avasesā ",
  "bv29:17.2": "janapadantake tadā ",
  "bv29:17.3": "paribhuttāni muninā ",
  "bv29:17.4": "mahessanti manujā tadā. ",
  "bv29:18.1": "dhātu vitthārikaṃ āsi ",
  "bv29:18.2": "gotamassa mahesino ",
  "bv29:18.3": "pāṇīnaṃ anukampāya ",
  "bv29:18.4": "ahu porāṇikaṃ tadāti. dhātubhājanīyakathā niṭṭhitā. buddhavaṃso niṭṭhito. suttantapiṭake khuddakanikāyassa cariyāpiṭakaṃ suttantapiṭake khuddakanikāyassa cariyāpiṭakaṃ namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa. 1. dānapāramitā "
